 "method": "Custom photon/electron MC + analytical slowing-down model. Photon transport (3e6 histories, track-length next-event estimators) scored primary/scattered photon fluence, spectra and cos(theta) distributions in the 0.628 cm^3 cylinder at 5 cm and 15 depths; primary fluence normalised by Phi0 (1/(0.01 sr x 105^2)). Interactions at the point from fluence spectra x process cross sections (Klein-Nishina, photoelectric, pair, Rayleigh fitted to NIST water). Initial electrons from Compton kinematics, photoelectron and pair sharing. Electron fluence from iterated CSDA equilibrium with Moller delta rays (10 keV cutoff, restricted stopping power); angular distribution from an electron track MC with multiple scattering. K, Kcol from spectra x mu_tr, mu_en; D=Kcol at CPE (beta=1); PDD from Kcol(5)/Kcol(0.5).",
